il/feature-catalog/convergence-and-rollback/two-of-three-agree-triggers-convergence.md:31:Current behavior is grounded in `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/convergence-signals.md`, which the scenario identifies as convergence rule. Validation is anchored by `manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-rollback/two-of-three-agree-triggers-convergence.md`, covering manual scenario contract.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/feature-catalog/convergence-and-rollback/two-of-three-agree-triggers-convergence.md:43:| `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/convergence-signals.md` | Reference | Convergence rule |\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/failure-handling.md:185:simulated cli-opencode lens\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/failure-handling.md:186:simulated cli-opencode lens\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/failure-handling.md:193:cli-opencode recommended...\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/failure-handling.md:194:cli-opencode confirmed...\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/failure-handling.md:242:{\"event\":\"rollback\",\"round_id\":\"round-001\",\"reason\":\"seat quorum failed\",\"timestamp\":\"<ISO>\",\"supersedes\":[\"seats/round-001/seat-001-cli-opencode.md\"]}\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/convergence/failure-handling.md:257:- Agent body: `.opencode/agents/ai-council.md` §10 FAILURE HANDLING and §17 ROLLBACK FOR OPERATORS.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/assets/conformance-benchmark/command-surface/fixtures/fixture-manifest.json:3:  \"benchmarkId\": \"command-surface\",\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/assets/conformance-benchmark/command-surface/fixtures/fixture-manifest.json:5:    \"oracleId\": \"command-surface